{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（14日）第3集劇情講述，官孝賢（張智霖飾）高調迎娶洪海允（高海寧飾），一來藉此洗脫妨礙司法公正罪名，二來順勢引爆官孝君（吳卓羲飾）與王雪瑩Kate（張曦雯飾）夫妻間的矛盾。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:20:08.500207+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:23:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:17:39.807628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:17:38.344702+00:00","content_hash":"3204dcf0927f9e3bc520a40b2e0610fc0079844a25fb399a935c104fb7abddb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}